<title>MALAYSIA: KL tin ends unchanged at 14.82 ringgit.</title>
<headline>KL tin ends unchanged at 14.82 ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tin price ended unchanged at 14.82 ringgit ($5.92) a kg after both sellers and buyers decided to close deals at the opening level, traders said.</p>
<p>Turnover was 102 tonnes compared with 93 on Tuesday, with buying from Malaysia and Europe, they said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is holding steady following LME's rise,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>The price differential over London was at $35 a tonne premium against $40 previously.</p>
<p>-- Tan Lee Lee (603-230-8911) ($1=2.5010 ringgit)</p>
